## SQ-PTH-02 | cobweb tier: lone web -0.5, cube centre -0.65, keeps moving, barbed wire hurts (razor wire added)
> setblock 1000 -60 1070 minecraft:cobweb
> fill 1004 -60 1069 1006 -58 1071 minecraft:cobweb
> setblock 1010 -60 1070 immersiveengineering:razor_wire
> setblock 1014 -60 1070 createaddition:barbed_wire
> summon minecraft:zombie 1000.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02a","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1005.5 -59 1070.5 {Tags:["z02c","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1010.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02r","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1014.5 -60 1070.5 {Tags:["z02b","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> setblock 1010 -60 1080 minecraft:cobweb
> setblock 1010 -60 1084 createaddition:barbed_wire
> tp Q 1018.5 -60 1082.5
> summon minecraft:zombie 1004.5 -60 1080.5 {Tags:["z02m","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1004.5 -60 1084.5 {Tags:["z02w","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b}
> zpth watch z02m 200 2
> zpth watch z02w 200 2
sleep 4
> zpth mod z02a
> zpth mod z02c
> zpth mod z02r
> zpth mod z02b
sleep 7
> zpth mod z02b
> zpth mod z02w
waitlog watch done z02w 30
