## SQ-PTH-18 | IW thorns in 6 and 7 layer spruce piles (moving zombies, no leggings vs leather leggings), modifier -0.55
shell grep -n 'leaf_piles_slow' config/immersive_weathering*.toml config/immersive_weathering/*.json* 2>/dev/null | head -3
> setblock 1000 -60 1150 immersive_weathering:spruce_leaf_pile[layers=6]
> setblock 1004 -60 1150 immersive_weathering:spruce_leaf_pile[layers=7]
> setblock 1008 -60 1150 immersive_weathering:spruce_leaf_pile[layers=6]
> setblock 1012 -60 1150 immersive_weathering:spruce_leaf_pile[layers=7]
> summon minecraft:zombie 1000.5 -60 1150.5 {Tags:["z18a","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1004.5 -60 1150.5 {Tags:["z18b","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1008.5 -60 1150.5 {Tags:["z18c","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}],ArmorItems:[{},{id:"minecraft:leather_leggings",Count:1b},{},{}]}
> summon minecraft:zombie 1012.5 -60 1150.5 {Tags:["z18d","pth"],PersistenceRequired:1b,IsBaby:0b,CanPickUpLoot:0b,Attributes:[{Name:"minecraft:generic.movement_speed",Base:0d}],ArmorItems:[{},{id:"minecraft:leather_leggings",Count:1b},{},{}]}
> tag @e[tag=z18a] add z18
> tag @e[tag=z18b] add z18
> tag @e[tag=z18c] add z18
> tag @e[tag=z18d] add z18
sleep 1
> zpth mod z18
pace 0.5
repeat 10
> zpth motion z18 0.15 0 0
> zpth motion z18 -0.15 0 0
end
pace 1
> zpth mod z18
look z18a hp 20 -> lower (0.5 per hit), z18b (1.0 per hit), z18c/z18d 20; all mod=-0.550

