## SQ-PTH-24 | IE revolver shot and Blocky Siege cannon ball pass a cube at full speed; snowball breaks in the centre
> fill 1010 -60 1179 1012 -58 1181 minecraft:cobweb
> summon immersiveengineering:revolver_shot 1004.5 -58.5 1180.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["m24a"]}
> zpth watch m24a 45 1
> zpth launch m24a none 1.5 0 0
sleep 2
> summon blocky_siege:projectile_cannon_ball_projectile_projectile 1004.5 -58.5 1180.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["m24b"]}
> zpth watch m24b 45 1
> zpth launch m24b none 1.5 0 0
sleep 2
> summon minecraft:snowball 1004.5 -58.5 1180.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["m24c"]}
> zpth watch m24c 45 1
> zpth launch m24c none 1.5 0 0
sleep 2
look m24a / m24b: x passes 1013 with mot x about 1.5 (ng off: gravity drop allowed); m24c gone near x 1011.5

## SQ-PTH-08r | orbs fall into a lone web with the bot 12 blocks away, then the bot stands 4 blocks away: held, no homing; touch collects
> setblock 1000 -60 1134 minecraft:cobweb
> tag P remove bP
> tp P 1012.5 -60 1134.5
> xp set P 0 levels
> xp set P 0 points
> summon minecraft:experience_orb 1000.5 -57 1134.5 {Value:5,Tags:["o08"]}
> summon minecraft:experience_orb 1000.5 -57 1134.5 {Value:5,Tags:["o08"]}
> summon minecraft:experience_orb 1000.5 -57 1134.5 {Value:5,Tags:["o08"]}
> summon minecraft:experience_orb 1000.5 -57 1134.5 {Value:5,Tags:["o08"]}
> summon minecraft:experience_orb 1000.5 -57 1134.5 {Value:5,Tags:["o08"]}
sleep 3
> zpth mod o08
> tp P 1004.5 -60 1134.5
sleep 4
> zpth mod o08
sleep 4
> zpth mod o08
> xp query P points
> pbot path P 1000.5 -60 1134.5 0.1
sleep 5
> zpth count o08
> xp query P levels
> xp query P points
expect count o08 n=0
look orbs in x 1000..1001 y -60..-59 z 1134..1135 at all three reads, same positions; P 0 points before the walk, 25 total after (level 2 + 9)

